Package: netlogoDuck
Title: Run NetLogo BehaviorSpace Experiments into DuckDB
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Shige", "Song", email = "shigesong@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Runs NetLogo BehaviorSpace experiments via the 'logolink'
    package and streams the results into a 'DuckDB' database for statistical
    analysis. Provides helpers to define experiments, run them, ingest
    existing BehaviorSpace CSV exports, and lazily read results back as
    'duckplyr' frames.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    DBI,
    duckdb,
    duckplyr,
    dplyr,
    logolink
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
LazyData: true
